{
  "_note": "Reference numbers for the PCB kit's footprints (footprints.ts), copied from each source as it gives them, in the source's own frame, read 2026-10-14. A source's toKit maps its point (sx, sy) to the footprint frame (x right, y up, seen from the top, origin at the part's centre): x = x[0] sx + x[1] sy + x[2], and y the same with y. footprints.test.ts holds the library to these to 0.01 mm, and the audit (intent.ts) holds every placed part to them. research/pcb-verification.md section 3 compares them.",
